{"name": "Fast Forward", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast Forward\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, vaporwave-inspired movement shooter where style meets speed. Play as Dizzy to dash, blast, and grapple through glitchy neon worlds in time-based levels that reward precision, flow, and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you beat the clock before the system flatlines?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slide into Action:\u00a0</strong>Defy gravity with wall-running and smooth sliding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.poster.avif?t=1758418064\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.webm?t=1758418064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/e79554ac44f8b8ed2ccdb934c7c32c9b.mp4?t=1758418064\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gunplay in Motion:\u00a0</strong>Unload on enemies while moving at high velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/5783694dede6e39f8408d931261d1cd5.poster.avif?t=1758418064\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999640/extras/5783694dede6e39f8408d931261d1cd5.web